  "美中期选举蓝色海啸与美股史诗级肥尾暴跌、标普跌4.36%与半导体暴跌12.25%、VIX飙升69.7%终结低波动、半导体价格泡沫出清与NeoCloud债务CDS飙升、德州与佐治亚限制数据中心及国会自担电网成本法案、2028资本开支瓶颈重塑、中东美军增兵与三路径演进、标普与半导体历史跌幅后回报统计、垃圾债与90/90反转信号、2000年中国独立行情先例与均值回归主题；数据均为文章时点观察，非实时行情。": "US midterm Blue Wave and epic fat-tail selloff, S&P down 4.36% and SOX down 12.25%, VIX up 69.7% ending low volatility, semiconductor price bubble unwinding and NeoCloud CDS blowout, Texas/Georgia datacenter curbs and Congressional grid-cost bill, 2028 capex bottlenecks, Middle East troop buildup and three war paths, historical return stats after large drops, high-yield debt and 90/90 reversal signals, 2000 China decoupling precedent, and mean-reversion theme; all data are dated article observations, not live market quotes.",
