  "标普单日暴跌4.36%距高点仅回撤6%，历史20次单日跌超4%后3个月回报中位数达+7.3%（85%正胜率）；好在垃圾债未大跌且逼近90/90反转日，若经济基本面未出大问题则恐慌后技术修复概率高。": "S&P 500's 4.36% plunge leaves it only ~6% off its highs; historically, 20 single-day drops >4% saw a 3-month median return of +7.3% (85% win rate). Encouragingly, high-yield debt did not crash and the market nears a 90/90 reversal day, making a technical rebound probable if macroeconomic fundamentals hold.",
  "费城半导体单日暴跌12.25%（近30年第2大跌幅），自6月22日见顶已跌近40%；历史16次跌超8%后3个月中位数仅+0.1%、12个月胜率仅53%；价格泡沫抛物线式下跌出清是中继而非终点。": "Philadelphia Semiconductor Index's 12.25% collapse (second worst in 30 years) brings its pullback from June 22 to nearly 40%; historically, 16 single-day drops >8% saw 3-month median gains of only +0.1% and a 12-month win rate of just 53%, showing bubble clearance is a continuation rather than the end.",
  "算力真实需求仍在，但NeoCloud公司债CDS飙升暴露出举债现金流风险；民主党掌控两院使宽松政策不再，众院通过法案要求数据中心自担电网成本，2028年约30%新增容量面临暂停与电费上涨。": "Real compute demand persists, but surging NeoCloud CDS spreads reveal debt-financed cash flow risks; Democratic control of Congress ends the lax policy environment as the House passed a bill requiring datacenters to pay grid costs, placing ~30% of 2028 new capacity at risk of delays and rising power tariffs.",
  "美军双航母群集结增兵中东，大选后打击窗口打开；油价面临临时协议（80美元）、维持现状（95-110美元）与地面夺岛（突破年内新高）三路径，美战略石油储备降至1982年最低使下行缓冲薄弱。": "US deployment of dual carrier groups boosts Middle East forces as the post-election strike window opens; oil faces three paths: a temporary truce ($80), the status quo ($95–110), or ground escalation (record highs), while US SPR at 1982 lows leaves thin downside buffers.",
  "标普跌4.36%创4-5倍方差肥尾事件，VIX暴涨近70%迫使做多资金去杠杆并引发百亿对冲基金强平危机；但垃圾债未跌且逼近90/90技术反转日，美联储难再加息，正反势能均趋向均值回归。": "S&P's 4.36% drop is a 4-5 sigma fat-tail event; VIX surging ~70% forced long-market volatility sellers to deleverage and triggered margin liquidation distress at multi-billion hedge funds. Yet junk bonds held up and a 90/90 technical reversal nears while Fed rate hikes near an end, pointing to mean reversion.",
  "外盘暴跌主要因对冲基金爆仓强平及情绪恐慌驱动，但‘美国缺电、中国缺芯’格局未变；2000年美股科技泡沫破灭后中国曾上涨一年半跑赢美股60%，中美周期未必同步，美联储转向预期支持均值回归。": "External market drops were driven primarily by hedge fund margin liquidations and panic, but the 'US lacks power, China lacks chips' reality persists; China rose for 1.5 years and beat the US by 60% after the 2000 tech bust, showing cycles need not synchronize as Fed pivot hopes support mean reversion.",
